# The bundled extension sources are deployed BYTE-FOR-BYTE into
# ~/.pi/agent/extensions/ and compared against the deployed copy to decide
# whether the user has edited them. With core.autocrlf=true these files would be
# checked out as CRLF while the deployed copies stay LF, so every launch would
# see a "difference" that is pure line-ending noise. Pin them to LF.
extensions-seed/*.ts text eol=lf
extensions-seed/manifest.json text eol=lf
extensions-seed/package.json text eol=lf
